{"4713760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "STROIDZ!", "steam_appid": 4713760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713760/extras/5c29120c062ed1374be94f193112aaae.gif?t=1780572259\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713760/extras/5c29120c062ed1374be94f193112aaae.poster.avif?t=1780572259\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2592, you are an elite pilot in the Quarriors Guild Space Force. As the Great Solar War rages around the solar system, the Quarriors live in self-imposed exile. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to clear a dangerous asteroid field before the Incorporated Network States find you. AI-powered C.O.R.P.O. drones will hunt you on behalf of the COMPLIANCE ENFORCEMENT OVERLORD using:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic top-down arcade action! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect power-ups!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weighty, inertia-based controls! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crunchy space combat! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand pixeled artwork made by a human!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer Synthwave slappage and 16-bit SFX made by humans!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclamation marks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No vibe coding here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to 100K points??</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the resistance, fight the Corpos, kill the C.E.O. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713760/extras/5c29120c062ed1374be94f193112aaae.gif?t=1780572259\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713760/extras/5c29120c062ed1374be94f193112aaae.poster.avif?t=1780572259\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2592, you are an elite pilot in the Quarriors Guild Space Force. As the Great Solar War rages around the solar system, the Quarriors live in self-imposed exile. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to clear a dangerous asteroid field before the Incorporated Network States find you. AI-powered C.O.R.P.O. drones will hunt you on behalf of the COMPLIANCE ENFORCEMENT OVERLORD using:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic top-down arcade action! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect power-ups!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weighty, inertia-based controls! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crunchy space combat! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand pixeled artwork made by a human!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer Synthwave slappage and 16-bit SFX made by humans!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclamation marks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No vibe coding here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to 100K points??</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the resistance, fight the Corpos, kill the C.E.O. </p>", "short_description": "Clear the asteroid field before the Corpos hunt you down with their AI weaponry!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713760/848e25a61679180de6cac6f11df756bc93b7a577/header.jpg?t=1780572259", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713760/2d3ac34cb0441168ca776274398afd482